---
title: Robots
description: "Robots built by FIRST Robotics Competition Team 1102 over the years, with notes on how each one works."
permalink: /robots/
---
{% set bots = robots | byYearDesc %}
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Our robots</h1>
    <p>Every season, students design, machine, and program a new robot in about six weeks. These are the ones we have built.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--moss" aria-hidden="true"></div>

{% if bots.length %}
{% for r in bots %}
<section class="band{% if loop.index0 % 2 == 1 %} band--fog2{% endif %}" id="robot-{{ r.year }}">
  <div class="wrap robot">
    <div class="robot__media">
      {% if r.photo and r.photo.file %}
      <img src="{{ ('/assets/img/robots/' + r.photo.file) | url }}" alt="{{ r.photo.alt }}" width="{{ r.photo.width }}" height="{{ r.photo.height }}"{% if not loop.first %} loading="lazy"{% endif %}>
      {% else %}
      <div class="robot__tile" aria-hidden="true"><span>{{ r.year }}</span></div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="robot__body">
      <p class="robot__season">{{ r.year }} season{% if r.game %}: {{ r.game }}{% endif %}</p>
      <h2>{{ r.name or ("Team " + site.teamNumber + " robot") }}</h2>
      {% if r.summary %}<p class="robot__summary">{{ r.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      {% if r.specs and r.specs.length %}
      <dl class="specs">
        {% for s in r.specs %}
        <div><dt>{{ s.label }}</dt><dd>{{ s.value }}</dd></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>
      {% endif %}
      {% if r.results %}<p class="robot__results"><strong>Results.</strong> {{ r.results }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--line" href="https://www.thebluealliance.com/team/{{ site.teamNumber }}/{{ r.year }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">{{ r.year }} on The Blue Alliance</a>
        {% if r.videoUrl %}<a class="btn btn--line" href="{{ r.videoUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Watch the robot</a>{% endif %}
        {% if r.cadUrl %}<a class="btn btn--line" href="{{ r.cadUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">See the CAD</a>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__head">
      <h2>Robot gallery</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="empty">
      <h3>Robot profiles are on the way</h3>
      <p>Each past robot will get its own section here, with photos and how it played the game. In the meantime, our match history is on The Blue Alliance.</p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 0">
        <a class="btn btn--moss" href="https://www.thebluealliance.com/team/{{ site.teamNumber }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Team {{ site.teamNumber }} on The Blue Alliance</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Help build the next one</h2>
    <p>Every robot on this page was built by students. Come build the next one.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ '/join/' | url }}">Join the team</a>
      <a class="btn btn--line" href="{{ '/sponsors/' | url }}">Sponsor the team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
